ailab-modelsvc 0008 (claude1 2026-10-31, Travis): disk first - NAS -> persistent tier -> RAM for every kind; the persistent tier never prunes a file that is on the RAM drive.
Against modelsvc/tiers.py after 0007 (md5 36ab90d0, both hosts). Generated on ai-epyc from tiers.py.bak-diskfirst-20261031075020.
Re-apply: cd /opt/ailab-modelsvc && patch -p1 < this

